                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Rating: 7.9/10\n\nCandy Blast is a colorful and casual puzzle game that focuses on matching candies, clearing levels, and completing simple objectives through quick and accessible gameplay. The concept is easy to understand, making it possible to start playing almost immediately without needing to learn complicated mechanics. Its bright visual style and straightforward structure give the game a relaxed feel that works particularly well for short gaming sessions.\n\nThe game's strongest aspect is its simplicity. Matching candies and creating combinations provides a satisfying sense of progression, while the gradually increasing difficulty gives players a reason to keep improving. The colorful presentation fits the theme well, and the responsive gameplay makes completing successful combinations feel rewarding. The game also does a good job of keeping the focus on the puzzle mechanics rather than adding unnecessary systems, which makes it easy to return to for a quick session.\n\nThe main limitation is that the basic puzzle formula can become repetitive after extended play. Players looking for deeper strategy, more complex mechanics, or a strong narrative experience may find the overall design somewhat limited. More variation in level objectives and additional gameplay mechanics could also have added greater long-term appeal. Despite these issues, Candy Blast remains an enjoyable casual puzzle game. Its colorful presentation, accessible mechanics, and satisfying matching gameplay make it a good choice for players looking for something simple and relaxing to play.",
